{"assets":["/statement-assets/c221a54cdaea5a1b6a7209c9351602b1a771f3b442976e2a8f21971fe1930380.png","/statement-assets/ae84e97c65a84111822a4a79660b13cfd0b16fbc1a5c92efb5c8829901d20e8d.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"366","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Dima and Salad"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Dima, Inna and Seryozha have gathered in a room. That's right, someone's got to go. To cheer Seryozha up and inspire him to have a walk, Inna decided to cook something. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Dima and Seryozha have "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" fruits in the fridge. Each fruit has two parameters: the taste and the number of calories. Inna decided to make a fruit salad, so she wants to take some fruits from the fridge for it. Inna follows a certain principle as she chooses the fruits: the total taste to the total calories ratio of the chosen fruits must equal "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". In other words, "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c221a54cdaea5a1b6a7209c9351602b1a771f3b442976e2a8f21971fe1930380.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" , where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the taste of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th chosen fruit and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bj"},{"kind":"text","text":" is its calories."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Inna hasn't chosen the fruits yet, she is thinking: what is the maximum taste of the chosen fruits if she strictly follows her principle? Help Inna solve this culinary problem — now the happiness of a young couple is in your hands!"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Inna loves Dima very much so she wants to make the salad from at least one fruit."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n ≤ 100, 1 ≤ k ≤ 10)"},{"kind":"text","text":". The second line of the input contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ ai ≤ 100)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the fruits' tastes. The third line of the input contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1, b2, ..., bn"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ bi ≤ 100)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the fruits' calories. Fruit number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" has taste "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" and calories "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there is no way Inna can choose the fruits for the salad, print in the single line number -1. Otherwise, print a single integer — the maximum possible sum of the taste values of the chosen fruits."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2\n10 8 1\n2 7 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"18\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 3\n4 4 4 4 4\n2 2 2 2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test sample we can get the total taste of the fruits equal to 18 if we choose fruit number 1 and fruit number 2, then the total calories will equal 9. The condition "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ae84e97c65a84111822a4a79660b13cfd0b16fbc1a5c92efb5c8829901d20e8d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" fulfills, that's exactly what Inna wants."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test sample we cannot choose the fruits so as to follow Inna's principle."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"366C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/366/problem/C"}